      "writtenOn": "2026-05-12T10:45:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for sharing the insight on using READ_ONCE!\n\nMaybe the READ_ONCE usage guidelines in the hypervisor could be summarized as:\n#1.If host-writable data controls code execution or is used to check conditions (e.g., size, boundary), READ_ONCE is mandatory to prevent ToCToU issues.\n#2.If the host-writable data is passed directly to the guest VM without hypervisor intervention, `READ_ONCE` is optional.",
